1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,948
Mute stops the other person hearing you.

2
00:00:05,948 --> 00:00:09,414
Hold puts them on hold, and Resume brings them back.

3
00:00:09,414 --> 00:00:15,030
Keypad sends key presses, for example to pick an option in another company's phone menu.

4
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:20,015
Hang up ends the selected call, and is the only red button.

5
00:00:20,015 --> 00:00:24,705
With two or more calls, End all ends every call after you confirm,

6
00:00:24,705 --> 00:00:26,920
and Active calls lists them.

7
00:00:27,670 --> 00:00:32,789
Add call puts the current call on hold, and opens the keypad for the second one.

8
00:00:32,789 --> 00:00:36,360
Back to call, or Escape, takes the held call off hold.

